WEBVTT

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:14.350
Sensei...

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.270
Hashiba-kun?

00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:18.470
What are you doing?

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:23.190
Sorry, this is a mistake!

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:27.110
Um, I gave a scarf to
Koboyakawa-san and—

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.780
No, my notebook...

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:31.740
Um...

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.320
Excuse me!

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:35.160
Hashiba-kun?

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:36.740
Huh?

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:38.160
Was there someone here?

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:39.490
Oh, are you awake?

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:40.830
That was Hashiba-kun.

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:45.250
Sensei, you were the Ox-King and
we were fighting each other...

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.800
Had another strange dream?

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:50.680
He was saying something about a scarf...

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:52.820
A scarf?

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:56.260
I'm returning this.

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:00.140
Why?

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:02.980
I thought it was cute, so I used it.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:06.280
But I didn't realize it was
you who gave it to me.

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:09.820
There are some discount coupons
for karaoke to apologize.

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.540
I really don't mind.

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:14.580
I was actually quite happy
to see you using it!

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:15.470
Why?

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:19.320
Well, I was going to
give it to my girlfriend,

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:20.750
but she kind of dumped me...

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:24.510
It did look like you
might have been dumped.

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:26.090
Huh, really?

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:28.670
You had tears in your eyes.

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:31.140
So, after a bit of thinking,

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:34.010
I figured it had some
sentimental value for you.

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:35.270
No.

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:36.630
Not at all...

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:37.880
Really?

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:41.060
But I'd feel bad for keeping it,
so I'm still giving it back.

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:42.900
Um, sure...

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:44.650
Then I'll be—

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:46.820
Right, at the karaoke place...

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:49.690
Thank you for standing up for me.

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:53.660
Bye.

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:55.440
Um...

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:58.700
Kobayakawa-san, are you and
Katakura-sensei going out?

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:01.080
Huh?

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:04.840
You're always sleeping in his office...

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:05.380
Um...

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:09.250
I have hay fever...

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:11.340
On Christmas,

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:14.010
whenever I saw someone
with a runny nose,

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:15.430
I offered tissues.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:21.810
Oh, the medication I take have the
side effect of making me sleepy.

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:24.320
Constantly going to the
infirmary is awkward...

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:27.400
So Katakura-sensei allows
me to sleep in his office.

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:29.950
I-I see...

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:30.780
I'm sorry.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:33.900
That was a very weird thing to ask...

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:34.740
No...

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:37.030
Please sing at our place again.

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:39.150
Yeah.

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:16.630
Valentine's Day...

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:19.650
I'd like it if Kobayakawa-san
gave me chocolates...

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.070
Na-chan!

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:26.410
K-Kobayakawa-san?

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:28.290
Good morning.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:29.250
Did you have P.E?

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:31.460
Yeah, basketball.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:35.250
Kobayakawa-san, I've heard
this guy likes chocolate!

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.050
Chocolate?

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:37.590
No, forget he said anything.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:39.220
Oh, that looks heavy!

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:40.630
Where are you taking it?

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:43.770
Um, to Katakura-sensei's office.

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:45.600
What happened to your face?

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:48.480
It's all swollen up.

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:50.900
Um, well...

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:51.670
That was—

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:52.940
Anna!

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:55.820
Oh, Mari-chan.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.780
Why were you talking
with these guys?

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:01.780
You'll become a creep,
just like them!

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:07.620
I don't think she'll become
a creep that easily...

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.960
So your name is Mari-chan?
That's a really cute name.

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:14.740
Mari-chan, you can give me
chocolates if you'd like.

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:16.290
Creepy.

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:21.150
<i>You can give me chocolates?</i>
You're being snobby, it's creepy.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:24.510
Why would I give a
creep like you chocolates?

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:26.810
Also, don't call me
Mari-chan, you creep.

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:29.050
Let's go, I'll help you!

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.180
Thank you.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.370
Anna, wait for me!

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:46.120
She really is something, isn't she?

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:47.210
Not cute at all...

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:48.950
Kill...

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:51.100
I'm going to murder that spitting woman!

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:53.370
Mattsun, please calm down!

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:57.250
She just called me creepy, four times!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:00.210
So you can get mad at woman too?

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:04.090
But now you've told Kobayakawa-san
that I like chocolate...

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:06.930
I only said that for your own sake!

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:08.470
I know you want chocolates.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:10.150
Well, I do, but...

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:11.770
If you really want it,

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:13.060
why not give her some?

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:14.850
Reverse chocolate.

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:17.650
My girlfriend wants me
to give some to her.

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:19.850
<i>Reverse chocolate?</i>

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:23.120
<i>Take this as a token of my affection.</i>

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:24.150
Natsuki-kun...

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:27.070
No, I won't be able to do that!

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.680
There's no way!

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:31.860
You really shouldn't take this so seriously.

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:34.920
Just say it's a thank you
for the karaoke coupons.

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:36.360
I see!

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:38.250
If you're buying some, I'll tag along.

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.960
Sorry, but could we make it ourselves?

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:42.020
What?

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:44.930
My girlfriend wants
handmade chocolates.

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:50.390
Apparently, imagining the guy who made
it completes the feeling for her.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:53.680
Um, I've never made any before...

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:55.110
It's okay,

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:57.150
I believe Mattsun knows how.

00:06:58.130 --> 00:07:01.070
You've made cake for
your little sister once, right?

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:03.150
I did, but...

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:05.610
Isn't this all about receiving?

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.820
Rina, you'll give me chocolates, right?

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:10.380
I guess I have no choice.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:12.210
Hey!

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:13.630
You're in my way!

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:14.710
Honestly...

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:17.620
Please don't have creepy talks
in front of my classroom.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:19.290
Really, you're such a creep!

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:23.420
Mattsun, are you and Tsutsui-san close?

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.170
No, not at all!

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:28.590
I just happen to know
one of her friends.

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:30.100
Kobayakawa-san, right?

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:32.060
They're always together.

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:35.590
Actually, I don't think I've ever
seen her with anyone else.

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:36.350
Really?

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:40.110
Kobayakawa-san seems
to be really quiet,

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:43.120
but Tsutsui-san, on the
other hand, is really harsh.

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:45.870
I've heard she really hates men.

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:47.280
Really...

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:51.740
Stop staring at me, you creep!

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:53.510
<i>She really hates guys...</i>

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:55.830
Then can't she just ignore them?

00:07:57.610 --> 00:07:59.190
Tomorrow, we'll go home first,

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:01.540
then we'll meet up at Mattsun's place.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.670
Huh, why?

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.540
For the chocolates of course...

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:07.420
Oh, right.

00:08:08.070 --> 00:08:10.340
Is something bugging you?

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:13.380
Hey, I was looking into some stuff earlier,

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.970
Gâteau au chocolat looks fancy, doesn't it?

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:17.520
Oh, that looks tasty!

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:19.390
Fondant cheesecake as well.

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:20.180
Are they talking about chocolate?

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:22.730
So we're doing truffles, okay?

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:40.710
We're done!

00:08:40.710 --> 00:08:43.010
Mattsun, thank you!

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:44.750
Yeah, sure...

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:53.650
Um, M-Ma—

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:55.100
Tsutsui-san...

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:57.970
U-Um, do you know if
Kobayakawa-san is around?

00:08:57.970 --> 00:09:00.730
I want to talk with her...

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:01.800
She's not here.

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:05.020
Ow...

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.600
What?

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:09.730
Huh?!

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:10.530
It's gone!

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:13.280
Did it fly away or something?

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:21.580
That's the spitting girl...

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:30.380
Hey!

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:33.090
This clearly isn't garbage.

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:36.240
Well, I didn't know that,

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:39.350
I saw it lying on the
ground, so I threw it out!

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:41.600
As I said, this isn't garbage.

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:42.980
It is...

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:46.020
It's total garbage!

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:48.680
That scarf too...

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:51.440
I already told you
not to mess with Anna!

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:55.410
She's a good girl who'll hang
out with people like me!

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:59.040
People say that you're harsh?

00:09:59.040 --> 00:09:59.910
How?

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.300
I don't think you are.

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:05.200
I've always been the closest to her!

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:07.800
She's never had guys
around her before!

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:09.200
I don't understand...

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:11.130
Don't do this to me!

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:13.550
It really, pisses me off...

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:16.400
Hey, come on...

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:19.310
Concern for friends is fine,
but crying over it?

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:20.640
That's not it!

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:23.020
She's not just a friend...

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:24.810
To me, Anna is...

00:10:27.030 --> 00:10:28.980
Feel free to mock me if you want!

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.570
I can't help it,

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:33.210
even I don't know!

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:34.820
Even I...

00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:42.170
You creep!

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:43.450
You've corrupted my lips!

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:46.330
Sorry, I couldn't help myself...

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:48.630
You...

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:49.800
You scumbag,

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:50.710
Die!

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:54.970
Cute...

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:05.530
Natsuki, what happened to you?

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:07.070
What's with that look?

00:11:07.070 --> 00:11:09.490
Koboyakawa-san gave him chocolates.

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:11.020
Really, love chocolates?

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:13.400
Hmm, I'd say obligatory.

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:16.390
Hey, Keiichi,

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:18.350
When do you normally kiss someone?

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:19.490
Whenever I feel like.

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.540
What if she insults you for it?

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:24.250
I'd get mad and punish her, obviously.

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:25.490
But...

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:27.420
What if she's really cute?

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:29.790
What do you mean?
